I always stay away from sac'ing any monster that could become a pet or
has been a pet. Nor any monsters of the same race as myself. While
under "some" circumstances you can safely do so, it is not not worth
the risk of error.

Peaceful creatures will negativly effect your alignment only if you do
the killing yourself. You are not held responsible for your pets
karma, and sacrificing these monsters is ok as long as they are not of
your race or a pet. This being said, it is a personal choice whether
to allow your pet to rampage or not. I would only allow it if it was a
low level pet and he needed experience. Part of the allure of Nethack
for me is the level of personal choice you have in following the
spirit or the letter of the rules.



